flowchart TD
    A[Training partition only] --> B[Rank measurement groups using training labels]
    A --> C[Clean training copy]
    B --> D[Three copies with top-three groups removed individually]
    C --> E[HGB: balanced log loss, sample weights]
    D --> E
    E --> F[Frozen classifier]
    V[Validation partition] --> W[Clean plus same three outage environments]
    F --> P[Validation scores]
    W --> P
    P --> T[One threshold maximizing equal-environment mean F1]
    X[Test rows: clean, five group outages, two MCAR rates] --> Y[Same frozen classifier]
    F --> Y
    Y --> Z[Scores compared with fixed threshold]
    T --> Z
    Z --> O[Fault predictions and held-out evaluation]
